  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">크로마토그래피 수업하면서 작품을 만들었습니다<br />의도한대로 안되더라도 제목만 잘 지으면 작품이 된다고 했더니 제목짓는 실력이 멋집니다<br /><br />단면이 아닌 입체작품도 잘 만들어내었어요^^<br />예상보다 더 멋진 작품이 나왔어요</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D2023359E80CA12F' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">밤하늘</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99C4FC3359E80CA337' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">감시자의 눈</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99FF353359E80CA528' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">폭발</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994B6D3359E80CA609' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">몽유도원도</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9957BF3359E80CA805' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">별이 빛나는 밤에</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99CABE3359E80CA90D' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">금수강산</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9929AD3359E80CAB04' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">사랑에 빠지다</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99857B3359E80CAD0E' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">무지개 노을</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99605F3359E80CAE34' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">무궁화개비</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99164D3359E80CB026' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">꽃</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99AE633359E80CB203' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">축음기</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A7BB3359E80CB401' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">플라워</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/990DC63359E80CB50D' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">드라이기로 말려 제출합니다</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A9233359E80CB625' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">정원</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99810B3359E80CB804' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">아기공작새</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992C0F3359E80CB937' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99EE183359E80CBA3E' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">밤하늘</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F2FC3359E80CBC07' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">초점</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F0D33359E80CBD2D' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">아름다운 오색꽃</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/991C863359E80CBF07' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">선생님 마음 ㅡ아부가 짱 이죠?</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9952BA3359E80CC007' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">불꽃놀이</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9931A43359E80CC126' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">불꽃놀이</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99C9133359E80CC326' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">아보카도</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99EE463359E80CC433' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">태극기</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9967693359E80CC606' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">달</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9940413359E80CC731' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E9363359E80CC903' class=\"txc-image\" /></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
